"Channels are connected to message backends using *connectors*. Connectors "
"are configured to map incoming messages to a specific channel (consumed by "
"the application) and collect outgoing messages sent to a specific channel. "
"Each connector is dedicated to a specific messaging technology. For example, "
"the connector dealing with Kafka is named `smallrye-kafka`."
