msgid ""
"The `KafkaClientService` is an experimental API and can change in the future."
""
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can also get the Kafka configuration injected to your application and "
"create Kafka producer, consumer and admin clients directly:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `default-kafka-broker` configuration map contains all application "
"properties prefixed with `kafka.` or `KAFKA_`.\n"
"For more configuration options check out <<kafka-configuration-resolution>>."
msgstr ""

