"On _outgoing_ channels, you can enable Snappy compression by setting the "
"`compression.type` attribute to `snappy`:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In JVM mode, it will work out of the box.\n"
"However, to compile your application to a native executable, you need to:"
