msgid "Authentication with OAuth"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If your Kafka broker uses OAuth as authentication mechanism, you need to "
"configure the Kafka consumer to enable this authentication process.\n"
"First, add the following dependency to your application:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This dependency provides the callback handler required to handle the OAuth "
"workflow.\n"
"Then, in the `application.properties`, add:"
msgstr ""

