"Update the `oauth.client.id`, `oauth.client.secret` and `oauth.token."
"endpoint.uri` values."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"OAuth authentication works for both JVM and native modes. Since SSL in not "
"enabled by default in native mode, `quarkus.ssl.native=true` must be added "
"to support JaasClientOauthLoginCallbackHandler, which uses SSL. (See the "
"xref:native-and-ssl.adoc[Using SSL with Native Executables] guide for more "
"details.)"
msgstr ""

