"broker.\n"
"To achieve this, you can _switch_ the channels managed by the Kafka "
"connector to _in-memory_."
msgstr ""

msgid "Let's say we want to test the following processor application:"
msgstr ""

msgid "First, add the following test dependency to your application:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Then, create a Quarkus Test Resource as follows:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Switch the incoming channel `orders` (expecting messages from Kafka) to in-"
"memory."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Switch the outgoing channel `beverages` (writing messages to Kafka) to in-"
"memory."
msgstr ""

