"Builds and returns a `Map` containing all the properties required to "
"configure the application to use in-memory channels."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When the test stops, clear the `InMemoryConnector` (discard all the received "
"and sent messages)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Create a Quarkus Test using the test resource created above:"
